macsCAD has no age restricted capabilities.  The application does not communicate with any servers, locally or internationally and so there is no ability for the software to be misused in this way.

while the software could in principle be used by a child, some of its more advanced features would require an understanding of higher level physicss and chemistry.

the applications has no content filters, but does not contain anything that may be considered as violent, profane, or of an adult nature.




